{
 "_help": [
  "Procedural animal bodies (scripts/CreatureModel.cs). An enemy type in data/enemies.json uses one with \"proc\": \"<id>\" (drawn instead of its .glb; remove \"proc\" there to go back to the old model).",
  "All sizes are metres of the animal at its natural size; the finished model is scaled so the top of the head (antlers, horns, ears, wings not counted) stands at the enemy's \"h\", times \"vis\".",
  "\"like\": another id whose numbers are used for everything not given here; then \"defaults\".",
  "Trunk: len (chest front to rump), leg (height of the hip and shoulder joints), chest / waist / rump = [half width, half height], wither (shoulder hump above the back line), lump (0..0.15 woolly surface), bodyPitch (deg, nose up: upright birds), seg (smoothness, sides per ring).",
  "Legs: legs 4 | 2 | 0, legR (upper leg radius), hindK (thigh thickness), stance (leg spacing x body half width), sprawl 0..1 (lizard legs out to the side), foot paw | hoof | claw | bird | web, footSize, legZ (2 legs: where under the body, fraction of len).",
  "Neck: neckLen, neckAng (deg above level, forward), neckCurve (deg: + rises steeply then bends forward, an S; - the reverse), neckR [base, head end], mane (crest height), throat (glowing patches: the dragon's fire).",
  "Head: head [length, half width, half height], headAng (deg, - = nose down), snout [length, half width, half height at the tip], snoutDrop, jaw (a lower jaw that opens), eyeR, eyeUp, eye (colour), eyeGlow, brow, beard, comb, tusks.",
  "Ears: ear point | round | long | leaf | droop | none, earSize. Horns: horn antler | palm | back | curl | bull | dragon, hornSize, tines.",
  "Tail: tail bushy | taper | tuft | fan, tailLen, tailR, tailBulge, tailTip (tip radius x tailR), tailAng (deg, + raised), tailCurve (deg per joint, + curls up), tailSegs, tailSpade, sway.",
  "Wings: wing bird | bat, wingSpan (one wing), wingChord, flapHz, glide 0..1 (share of the time it soars), wingRest (0 spread .. 1 folded on the ground), flies (false: wings only for show).",
  "Coat: main, back, belly, legCol, footCol, headCol, neckCol, muzzle, snoutCol (beaks), nose, earCol, hornCol, tailCol, tailTipCol, tailUnder, wingCol, wingTipCol, spineCol, shellCol; pattern spots | fawn | patch | stripe | scale with patCol and patFreq.",
  "Other: grazer (lowers its head to feed when calm), grazeAng, hump, shell, spines (0..1.5 row of back spines), saddleZ (rider seat, fraction of len from the middle, - = forward), saddleUp, vis (drawn size x this over the hit size)."
 ],
